abandoned cathedrals of Alatyr-M, discovering secrets, hidden rooms, alternative routes, and shortcuts to save points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Religious and Philosophical Themes:</strong> Dive into a world where the religion of the Firstborn influences everything, shaping every aspect of life. The story unfolds through interactions with characters, texts, and discoveries along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Fights:</strong> Overcome foes who guard the ancient secrets of Alatyr-M \u2014 from ordinary to unique bosses, each encounter presenting a true test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/8c54b6f75b808dde76b009d7b44c29e2.poster.avif?t=1761508391\" width=558 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/8c54b6f75b808dde76b009d7b44c29e2.webm?t=1761508391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/8c54b6f75b808dde76b009d7b44c29e2.mp4?t=1761508391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Evolution and New Abilities:</strong> Unlock hidden abilities and upgrades to help you explore the world of Alatyr-M even further. Fine-tuning the strengths of the Nameless One will allow you to develop a unique fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unparalleled Atmosphere:</strong> With cynical marauders called Dromites, robots, and complex mechanisms brought to life under the arches of an ancient fortress, you\u2019re in for an immersive journey in a unique 2.5D style that occasionally shifts to full 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/4f1ef2c2e37d135a425a11fca211ae2c.poster.avif?t=1761508391\" width=558 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/4f1ef2c2e37d135a425a11fca211ae2c.webm?t=1761508391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/4f1ef2c2e37d135a425a11fca211ae2c.mp4?t=1761508391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you enjoy atmospheric and challenging adventures</strong>, sci-fi worlds with a philosophical undertone, and captivating stories about the struggle for purpose, then <strong>&quot;Among the Waves&quot; awaits you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["VS/Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/b632772bab838be057ab4a682107c09406c48d73/header.jpg?t=1761508391","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3347690/2128342558/48b9237b4875d527c126ffb82f368714a909ad5d/1761120529/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761203080","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3347690/2128342558/48b9237b4875d527c126ffb82f368714a909ad5d/1761120529/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761203080","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3347690/2128342558/48b9237b4875d527c126ffb82f368714a909ad5d/1761120529/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761203080","id":257220919,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220919/movie480.mp4?t=1761203080","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220919